{"id":"dtw","title":"Dynamic time warping","family":"elastic","definition":"reference","intro_en":"DTW compares ordered series while allowing repeated matches along a monotone alignment path. The animation builds squared pointwise costs, fills the dynamic-programming table, and traces a minimum-cost path. This reference example returns the square root of the total cost; EchoTime's composite dtw_similarity uses a different local cost and scaling.","intro_zh":"DTW 在保持先后顺序的前提下，允许同一个观测与多个观测匹配。动图依次展示平方局部误差、动态规划累计表和最低代价路径。本例返回累计代价的平方根；EchoTime 的复合 dtw_similarity 使用不同的局部代价与缩放。","steps_en":["Choose raw observations and any neighborhood descriptor.","Compute local squared discrepancies; apply the indicated weights or admissibility mask.","At each admissible cell, add its local cost to the smallest predecessor cost.","Trace one minimizing path and take the square root of its accumulated objective."],"steps_zh":["选择原始观测以及需要的邻域描述符。","计算局部平方误差，并施加指定权重或允许匹配的掩码。","在每个允许单元格，把局部代价加到三个前驱的最小累计代价上。","回溯一条最小化目标的路径，并对其累计目标值取平方根。"],"formula":"DTW(x,y) = sqrt(min_path sum_(i,j) (x_i-y_j)^2)","caveats_en":["Unrestricted warping can align events that should remain distinct; the output is not generally a metric.","Signal scale, path constraints and final normalization must match before distances from different tools are compared."],"caveats_zh":["无限制扭曲可能对齐本应区分的事件；该输出一般不满足全部度量公理。","比较不同工具的数值之前，须统一信号尺度、路径约束和最终归一化。"],"sources":[{"label":"tslearn: DTW definitions and path constraints","url":"https://tslearn.readthedocs.io/en/stable/user_guide/dtw.html"},{"label":"EchoTime imported atlas: named formula conventions","url":"https://github.com/ZipengWu365/EchoTime/blob/main/src/echotime/data/ts_similarity_package_v2_registry.csv"}],"x":[0.2,0.4,1.1,2.4,3.2,2.5,1.2,0.3,-0.4,-0.1],"y":[0.1,0.3,0.5,1.2,2.6,3.1,2.3,1.1,0.2,-0.3],"input_label":"Deterministic illustrative arrays; no benchmark data","parameters":{"local_cost":"squared Euclidean","final_square_root":true,"normalization":"none"},"result":{"la